# Generated SQL migrations live here. Files are produced by
# `pnpm db:generate` (which wraps `drizzle-kit generate`) and committed
# to git. drizzle-kit also writes a `meta/` subfolder with a
# `_journal.json` it uses to track which migrations exist — that
# metadata is committed too, but it is NOT the migration itself.
#
# Until the first schema lands in Phase 1 this directory only contains
# this placeholder.
